      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;cucumber-for-qa-engineers-completed&#34;&gt;Cucumber for QA Engineers (Completed)&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User:&lt;/strong&gt; Mohammed Shahid (&lt;a href=&#34;mailto:shahid.xkcd@gmail.com&#34;&gt;shahid.xkcd@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;strong&gt;Status:&lt;/strong&gt; Completed &amp;amp; Refined&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;prompt&#34;&gt;Prompt:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Teach me using a problem-driven, question-first approach. Start with the real problem that motivated the concept, ask me questions to think through it, let me attempt solutions, guide me through hints, and only reveal the full explanation after I&amp;rsquo;ve reasoned. No theory first — always discovery and questioning first&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Subject: cucumber api or lib fir QA Engineers&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
